      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CUT FROM ABOVE (5) produced a modest effort most recently when fifth at this track over 401m behind Spanish Brook (23.85) in a Maiden. Placed at her previous run. Should be very hard to beat this time. PIECE OF CAKE (4) turned spotting a big start finishing fifth (30.47) last time in a Maiden at Gosford. Form from her last run is proving to be solid. Cannot be left out. JACKIE SEPOL (7) was in the minors two back (22.63) at Gosford but ran below best last time there, finishing 6th. Can figure in the finish. TURBO TODD (1) found the frame for the second consecutive time when narrowly beaten into second last time out (18.84) over 318m at Dubbo.",
